                         ERASE
                         RESP(WS-RESP)
               END-EXEC.
               EXEC CICS RECEIVE MAP('ZCLMAP1I')
                         MAPSET('ZCLMAP11')
                         RESP(WS-RESP)
               END-EXEC.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       CHECK-PREMIUM-0057.
               INSPECT WS-KEY-CHAR REPLACING ALL SPACES BY '0'.
               IF WS-STATUS-FAILED
